{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おづじゃ〜〜ん！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobDH43q1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアー2026"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ始まりました！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうですか皆さん？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "盛り上がっていますか？？？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はとっても楽しんでおります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは福井公演が終わりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめまして福井！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださった皆さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心の中で応援してくださった皆さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "支えてくださったスタッフの皆さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お客さんとの距離が想像以上に近く"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの方と目を合わせることや"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "奥の方までペンライトやタオルを"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見ることができて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪型も2日間で変えたの！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わかりにくいかもしれないけど"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "編み込みとゆる巻きハーフアップです！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobztKkdk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobbaaJ2o.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色々な髪型に挑戦するガオ〜🦖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "福井は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝倉氏の城下町であった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一乗谷や"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "織田信長の家臣であった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "柴田勝家の城があり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text":